  "title": "TWFG, Inc. Announces Earlier Call Time for Upcoming Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Thursday, August 6, 2026",
  "summary": "THE WOODLANDS, Texas, July 30, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TWFG, Inc. (NASDAQ: TWFG), a leading independent insurance distribution platform, announced today that it will release its financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026, after the market closes on Wednesday, August 5, 2026.",
